## Configuration

| Field | Required | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| {{.Title}} URL (`base_url`) | yes | e.g. `https://cms.example.org` |
| API key (`api_key`) | no | Read-only. Stored encrypted; never shown again. |
| Extra hosts (`extra_hosts`) | no | Comma-separated, if images come from a CDN on another host. |

## How content maps to slides

| {{.Title}} | Slide |
|---|---|
| title | title |
| summary | body (plain text) |
| image | image |
| start / end | starts_at / expires_at |

